  m_text: "Hello Left Wing Dive Team\n\nOur team encuntered a creature on the rigth
    hand side of the ship. Please be cautious when heading out. This creature has
    yet to be identified but it attacked some of our Divers and their devices, causing
    us to be pushed back due to repairs. Be careful out there.\n \nStay Safe"
