      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Greetings Crew,


    Reminder that incase of an emergancy, power outage,
    system malfunction, etc. where the Bay doors are locked shut, please find a higher
    ranking officer to aid with unlocking the door, if there is a resonable reason
    too. Higher authroity officers can scan their keycard''s by holding their hand
    on the scanner next to every computer interface for the required amount of time.


    Furthrmore,
    the passcode resets every 20 seconds so be sure to take this information into
    account.


    Thank You'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
